{"resourceIdentifier":"2864","resourceName":"Xuancheng Composting Project Phase I","description":"The project introduced a set of organic fertilizers production lines with an annual output of 31,500 tons to treat the manure from the chicken farms and Biomass waste residue i.e. straw in Xuancheng City, Anhui Prvince. The purpose of the project activity is to avoid methane emissions through controlled aerobic treatment by composting of manure and biomass residue.\r\nIn absence of the project, all manure waste produced was left to decay in uncovered anaerobic lagoons, which is the most economic, viable and reasonable for livestock farm owners and the biomass waste residue had been left to decay anaerobically in a solid waste disposal site (SWDS).\r\nThe proposed project was designed to treat the chicken manure and biomass waste residue such as straw, plant ash, rice husk in Xuancheng City to produce organic fertilizer. The proposed project comprises of fermentation system and fertilizer production system, etc. It is estimated that approximately 75,000tons of manure and 18,750tons of biomass waste residue can treat annually, therefore total 93,750 tons of waste can be composted aerobically for this project. The final compost obtained will be sold to local businesses. The construction start date of the project is 01/05/2020 and was put into operation on 25/07/2020.\r\nThe project activity will reduce of GHG in the atmosphere through avoiding methane emissions from controlled aerobic treatment by composting of manure and biomass residue. It is estimated that 51,261 tCO2e emission reductions will be generated annually and total emission reductions are 512,613 tCO2e in the 10 years’ fixing crediting period.","location":{"latitude":30.746943,"longitude":119.002774},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-06-05","endExclusive":"2025-07-06","endInclusive":"2025-07-05"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value"